    "ExternalDescriptionStr" : "<div><figure class=\"table\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" align=\"left\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"padding: 0in 9pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">With the guidance of the Associate Director or others in the team, responsibilities will include design strategy, concept design and the production of detailed working drawings.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Actively seek inspiration and reference from sources outside of the business to support creative design solutions.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Source reference and carry out research to illustrate a design direction to the clients, working with architects and graphic designers in the project team.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Produce basic concept work using hand sketches or variety of digital and traditional media to a high standard.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Assist in assembling presentations using a variety of digital and traditional media, particularly Adobe InDesign.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Produce, under supervision, drawing packages for Schematic and Detail Stages.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Source reference material and carry out research to ensure that materials and products are fit for purpose.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Build knowledge of markets, our clients and their competitors.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">As directed, responsible for some basic project communication, including liaising with contractors, design &amp; construction team and written communications.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Proficient in creating developed design drawings (DD drawings), responsible for refining the conceptual design into detailed preliminary drawings, including space layout, dimension positioning, material selection and preliminary structural design, to bridge the gap between conceptual design and construction drawings.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Assist with recording design team or site meetings either by minutes, letters, emails or file notes.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><li><span style=\"color: windowtext; font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\">Provide support to any more junior team members.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;HelveticaNeueLT Std Lt&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">Provide ad-hoc support as required.</span></span></p>",
